sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-zhang-sorting-morphogenesis> a pk:Claim ;
        rdfs:label "Zhang, Goldstein & Levin (2025) Autonomous Cell-View Sorting Morphogenesis, 3-Ablation Platonic Space Audit & Hoel Causal Emergence 2.0 faithfully reproduces Autonomous self-sorting cell arrays (Bubble, Insertion & Selection algotypes on symmetric group S_n) morphology" ;
        dct:description "The simulation script(s) sorting-morphogenesis/validate_kymograph_and_paper.py, docs/media/zhang_sorting_morphogenesis.gif, docs/media/zhang_levin_platonic_claims_audit.png, docs/media/zhang_hoel_quantifying_emergence_ce2.png, docs/media/zhang_multilang_port_verification.png, sorting-morphogenesis/sorting_morphogenesis.py, sorting-morphogenesis/audit_platonic_space_claims.py, sorting-morphogenesis/quantify_emergence_ce2.py, sorting-morphogenesis/verify_multilang_ports.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Autonomous self-sorting cell arrays (Bubble, Insertion & Selection algotypes on symmetric group S_n) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 94.0/100, audit 2026-10-22-zhang-sorting-morphogenesis-audit-v2) and the assessments." ;
        dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/967dc2c3/docs/media/zhang_hoel_quantifying_emergence_ce2.png>,
            <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/967dc2c3/docs/media/zhang_levin_platonic_claims_audit.png>,
            <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/967dc2c3/docs/media/zhang_multilang_port_verification.png>,
            <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/967dc2c3/docs/media/zhang_sorting_morphogenesis.gif>,
            <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/967dc2c3/sorting-morphogenesis/audit_platonic_space_claims.py>,
            <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/967dc2c3/sorting-morphogenesis/quantify_emergence_ce2.py>,
            <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/967dc2c3/sorting-morphogenesis/sorting_morphogenesis.py>,
            <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/967dc2c3/sorting-morphogenesis/validate_kymograph_and_paper.py>,
            <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/967dc2c3/sorting-morphogenesis/verify_multilang_ports.py> ;
        pk:context "script(s): https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/967dc2c3/sorting-morphogenesis/validate_kymograph_and_paper.py, https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/967dc2c3/docs/media/zhang_sorting_morphogenesis.gif, https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/967dc2c3/docs/media/zhang_levin_platonic_claims_audit.png, https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/967dc2c3/docs/media/zhang_hoel_quantifying_emergence_ce2.png, https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/967dc2c3/docs/media/zhang_multilang_port_verification.png, https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/967dc2c3/sorting-morphogenesis/sorting_morphogenesis.py, https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/967dc2c3/sorting-morphogenesis/audit_platonic_space_claims.py, https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/967dc2c3/sorting-morphogenesis/quantify_emergence_ce2.py, https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/967dc2c3/sorting-morphogenesis/verify_multilang_ports.py; output: docs/media/zhang_goldstein_levin_kymograph_validation.png; organism: Autonomous self-sorting cell arrays (Bubble, Insertion & Selection algotypes on symmetric group S_n); checkpoint commit: https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/commit/967dc2c3; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.5.4, scipy 1.16.3, matplotlib 3.10.7; claim_boundary: [reported_in_source: Zhang, Goldstein & Levin (2025) report decentralized cell-view efficiency, frozen-cell error tolerance, Delayed Gratification (DG > 0 on E(v)), and chimeric algotype clustering on unique (Fig. 8A) and duplicate (Fig. 8D) keys | Levin (2025/2026, Ingressing Minds Sec. 6.3 & Fig. 14) claims no error-handling code was added for broken cells, Delayed Gratification goes against the sorting gradient to bypass barriers, and algotype clustering is an unprogrammed side-quest not explained or produced by the medium; reconstructed_in_script: Bit-exact 4-language ports (Python 3, C++20, Node.js, Lean 4) reproducing 14/14 paper benchmarks with 0 cell mismatches, plus 3 code ablations and exact S_3..S_6 Markov TPM Causal Emergence 1.0 & 2.0 analysis; transfer_boundary: Proves that InsertionSortCell.py (L74-76) contains an explicit `if status == FREEZE: prev = -1` reset (4.5x error jump when ablated), Bubble/Insertion move 0 cells across an immovable barrier and descend strictly by Delta I = -1 on the Coxeter inversion potential I(v) (Hoel CE 2.0 = +0.1191 vs -0.2525 on E(v)), and C=2 duplicate keys produce Anti-Clustering (0.477 < 0.50, S B | S B); does_not_claim: Demonstrates that while Weak Structural Platonism (mathematical free lunches of S_n and kinematic speed waves) is justified, Strong Dualist Ingression P_dualist adds 0.00 differential predictions beyond the local Markov transition matrix D]" ;
        pk:derivedFromPaper <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.patter.2025.101472>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.1314922110>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1177/10597123241269740>,
            <https://doi.org/10.3390/philosophies11050161> ;
        pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-zhang-sorting-morphogenesis-code-traceability>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-zhang-sorting-morphogenesis-model-fidelity>,
